    {
      "number": 5,
      "folder": "05-lifecycle-and-operations",
      "title": "Lifecycle and operations",
      "ids": [],
      "objective": "Take an agent from a scoped idea through evaluation, release, operation and retirement.",
      "intro": "Agent work continues after the prototype. Plan the use case, build a bounded workflow, test representative conditions, release deliberately and monitor operations. Keep versions and ownership visible. When a result fails, inspect the artifact and its trajectory, then improve the appropriate part of the setup. Retire obsolete agents and access as deliberately as you introduce them.",
