      "ids": [
        97
      ],
      "objective": "Apply the same goal-context-tools-review pattern to different business domains.",
      "intro": "Every application uses the same practical questions: what is the goal, which sources are authoritative, what actions are allowed, what output should exist, and who reviews it? The examples in this chapter are original learning exercises using synthetic data. They illustrate workflow design rather than claim measured business results or live deployment.",
